# Loose feature screenshots — scratch output, rebuild with verify/screenshots.mjs
screenshots/*.png

# public/screenshots/<release>/ is deliberately NOT ignored: the in-app feature
# tour serves those images, so they have to be in the build. They are generated
# too, but a release's set is captured once and then frozen — the 0.9.0 images
# stay correct for 0.9.0 however far the UI moves on.
